day's First Moves: LUV & ETSY Upgrades, ABNB Price Target Hike\n\nRedburn is no longer in the bear camp for Southwest Airlines (LUV) after it issued an upgrade to neutral. Airbnb (ABNB) sees a price target hike from Citizens.\n\n### Airbnb price target raised to $200 from $190 at Citizens\n\nCitizens analyst Matthew Condon raised the firm’s price target on Airbnb (ABNB) to $200 from $190 and keeps an Outperform rating on the shares. Hotels and AI-powered pricing tools represent…\n\n### Airbnb assumed with an Equal Weight at Morgan Stanley","title":"Airbnb (ABNB) Stock Price & Overview","url":"https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/abnb/"},{"author":null,"id":"https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/abnb/statistics/","image":"https://stockanalysis.com/stockanalysis-1200x630.png","text":"Airbnb (ABNB) Statistics & Valuation\n\n172.01 -3.75 (-2.13%) At close: Oct 23, 2026, 4:00 PM EDT\n\n172.02 +0.01 (0.01%) After-hours: Oct 23, 2026, 7:59 PM EDT\n\n## Total Valuation\n\nAirbnb has a market cap or net worth of $101.41 billion. The enterprise value is $91.84 billion.\n\n| Market Cap | 101.41B |\n| --- | --- |\n| Enterprise Value | 91.84B |\n\n## Important Dates\n\nThe next confirmed earnings date is Thursday, November 5, 2026, after market close.\n\n| Earnings Date | Nov 5, 2026 |\n| --- | --- |\n| Ex-Dividend Date | n/a |\n\n## Share Statistics\n\nAirbnb has 589.59 million shares outstanding. The number of shares has decreased by -3.86% in one year.\n\n| Current Share Class | 419.53M |\n| --- | --- |\n| Shares Outstanding | 589.59M |\n| Shares Change (YoY) | -3.86% |\n| Shares Change (QoQ) | -1.81% |\n| Owned by Insiders (%) | 28.72% |\n| Owned by Institutions (%) | 65.33% |\n| Float | 405.77M |\n\n## Valuation Ratios\n\nThe trailing PE ratio is 38.92 and the forward PE ratio is 30.44. Airbnb's PEG ratio is 1.49.\n\n| PE Ratio | 38.92 |\n| --- | --- |\n| Forward PE | 30.44 |\n| PS Ratio | 7.71 |\n| Forward PS | 6.78 |\n| PB Ratio | 13.01 |\n| P/TBV Ratio | 14.42 |\n| P/FCF Ratio | 