ase.\n\n7 weeks ago - New York Post\n\n### Home Depot Stock (NYSE:HD) Notches Down With No Signs of Change in Housing Market\n\nThe housing market these days has not been kind to home improvement giant Home Depot ($HD). Americans are staying exactly where they are, and without people changing houses, that is…\n\n### The Home Depot to Present at the Goldman Sachs Global Consumer and Retail Conference\n\nATLANTA, Sept. 1, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- The Home Depot®, the world's largest home improvement retailer, today announced that Richard McPhail, executive vice president and CFO, and Billy Bastek, executi...\n\n7 weeks ago - PRNewsWire\n\n### Home Depot’s AI assistant Magic Apron to deliver in-store guidance\n\nHome Depot (HD) announced the nationwide rollout of new in-store capabilities for Magic Apron, its AI-powered shopping assistant. Using knowledge tailored to each customer’s chosen store, Magic Apron ...\n\n1 month ago - TheFly\n\n### The Home Depot Expands Magic Apron to Deliver Personalized & Localized In-Store Guidance\n\nThe Home Depot's AI assistant, Magic Apron, has expanded to include localized store knowledge in all U.S. stores to help customers and associates navigate stores more efficiently, quickly find product...\n\n### An Unloved 6.9% Dividend For Home Reno Boom 2.0\n\nHome Depot's stock is undervalued as investors mistakenly link it solely to new home sales. High mortgage rates are actually fueling a \"Home Reno Boom 2.0,\" as homeowners upgrade existing properties u...","title":"The Home Depot (HD) Stock Price & Overview","url":"https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/hd/"},{"author":null,"id":"https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/hd/statistics/","image":"https://stockanalysis.com/stockanalysis-1200x630.png","text":"The Home Depot (HD) Statistics & Valuation\n\n319.83 -7.90 (-2.41%) At close: Oct 23, 2026, 4:00 PM EDT\n\n319.64 -0.19 (-0.06%) After-hours: Oct 23, 2026, 7:56 PM EDT\n\n## Total Valuation\n\nThe Home Depot has a market cap or net worth of $319.09 